    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401903/2004019030170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女優",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "autoWaitTime": 1700
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女優",
    "text": "ふっ、ふふ……\r\nあははっ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女優",
    "text": "あなた何言い出すの？\r\nわけわかんない……ふふっ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019030180,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "えっと──\r\nちゃんと話ばせんとって思ったと……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401903/2004019030180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女優",
    "text": "……うん、ごめんなさい\r\n同族嫌悪だったのかもしれないわ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "bgm": "fade_out"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019030190,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ふぇ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200401903/2004019030190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女優",
    "text": "私もあなたと同じように地方から出てきて\r\nそれはもう方言ばりばりだったの",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "女優",
    "text": "で、そのまま片っ端からオーディション受けまくって──\r\n見事に全部落ちて……バイトして食いつないで……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "003"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004019030200,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
